ke this is a local problem and for the  most part it has a local solution I  think it's a bit of a myth though to say  that the that there's complete distrust  in communities between the police  there really isn't there's a still a lot  of people they call us they rely on us  they want us to help them you know a lot  of is the gang so most of the violence  is gang violence and they don't 9:59  major gangs with a lot of offshoots 2400  offshoots of these gangs and and among  the most vicious in the country and in  the world guys all of you thank you so  much for your input tonight

